{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3df582f2ccfdf07e4d58b8efd1a695edc1714dc67707be229fe9b344990255d4", "ja": "（ツアーの宣伝で、テレビ局にやってきた。\n朋花の出番はまだ先だが……様子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（为了宣传巡演，来到了电视台。朋花还要过一会儿才轮到出场，不过……不知道她现在怎么样了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "eaf78f6599bf43bec556cfaff8f9ffa5042bb1466885fc0e3976ea4c61ec2841", "ja": "ふぅ……なかなかうまくいきませんね～。\n今度こそは……。ここでボタンを押して……。", "zh": "呼……进展还真不顺利呢～  \n这次一定要……在这里按下按钮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "50098ca93b051dde6db095624f7acd32323b2d068d694abea85503dfe8e274df", "ja": "（あれは、携帯用のゲーム機か？\nどうやらゲームに集中しているみたいだな……）", "zh": "（那是便携式游戏机吗？看样子她好像正专心玩游戏……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "56eac531dc38c3c6bbf0b0288268d7c60105e394176bedfbf044b5a3a7bf963a", "ja": "やった……！　ついに、崖を飛び越えましたよ～。\nこれで、ゴールまであと少しですね～。", "zh": "成功了……！终于跳过悬崖了～。\n这样一来，离终点就只差一点了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ea330be880f72aa4f873674d5b2d9b43fdd63b9f80a7415025072c728f7fae8a", "ja": "朋花、楽しそうだな。何を熱心にやってるんだ？", "zh": "朋花，你看起来玩得很开心嘛。在认真做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "ebecc63df149e5571231a6f3bf0fe923b73b0997a1dfdf856a82cec5b575f65a", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん……\nもしかして、覗き見していたんですか～？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生……\n莫非您刚才在偷看吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "99796150dfbd0ff5a7211a5ddc165184367a6e71e95f45ce8b01b6a93166a874", "ja": "本当ならお仕置きものですが、今回は許しましょう～。\n私も、ゲームに集中していましたし……。", "zh": "按理说该罚您才是，不过这次就原谅您吧～我也正专心玩游戏呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1007_p", "source_sha256": "67e913cfc5ba7070f89561f4f49719a4db015a7135667970b1dcca9b024cf1e7", "ja": "やっぱり、ゲームで遊んでいたのか。\n珍しいと思って、声を掛けなかったんだ。", "zh": "果然是在玩游戏啊。因为觉得很少见，所以就没叫你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "4b9050ba215d7d80dae098d004f14494e4419da72d27a7ede171c824fa83fb2f", "ja": "学校で、ゲームについての話をしたら、\nクラスメイトが携帯ゲーム機を貸してくれたんです～。", "zh": "在学校聊起游戏的话题时，\n同班同学就把掌上游戏机借给我了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "78cd85779fe9e93f5fa3852bad352f632914f2a4013e18cd3a2ca9e96f02c42f", "ja": "ツアー先でも楽しめるから、と……。試しに\n持ってきたんですが、さっそく役に立ちましたね～。", "zh": "因为在巡演地点也能玩……所以我就试着带来了，没想到马上就派上用场了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "bce681be1a5545bc5e8913120916b9f4dc971cfcc79029bd083ad2f23a599cd4", "ja": "TVのお仕事は、待ち時間が長いので……。\n時間をつぶすのに、ちょうどいいですよ～。", "zh": "电视台的工作等待时间很长……\n拿来打发时间正好呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2da2207850b54042cc023081dfb5afb1f735753258775c0cb9e402418aa6072f", "ja": "それにしても、朋花は意外とゲームを\n楽しめてるんだな。よかったよ。", "zh": "不过话说回来，朋花居然还挺享受玩游戏的嘛。那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "3062a962bf1a0f184e27ef3f2f3447ccf66fd39a49867980d26ce1745a5616eb", "ja": "そうですね～。私も、すこし意外でしたが……\nこうして遊んでみると、案外、楽しいですよ～。", "zh": "是啊～我也觉得有点意外，不过……像这样玩起来，意外地还挺开心的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "f2288c78741650358aeb6d01602ae79cb5447bc66024e987fe3d3a76b118b5b0", "ja": "それに、貸してもらったのですから、\n成果をみせたほうが、相手も喜ぶかと～。", "zh": "而且既然是借来的，还是展示一下成果，对方也会更开心吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1014_p", "source_sha256": "de9d00d2d78821caeef1aa4c337a85247920dbb3646e2f322e30b42bfb52c490", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nよかったら、俺も攻略を手伝おうか？", "zh": "啊，说得也是。\n如果你不介意的话，要不要我也帮你攻略？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "79b3888d22eb60d6b6bfd174e72574e28b1a90b1f8acebb4c617f457b3aa5b58", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n私の話を聞いていましたか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n你有在听我说话吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "673bd926d6c2b9b1c405addbec1ba7e7e48562d11d486ed6ebd7e91fb28e444f", "ja": "これは、聖母の成すべきこと。\n手出しは不要ですよ～。", "zh": "这是圣母应尽之事。\n不用插手哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4283b65d6b460fd10e8a86c72a3544af0ebfb4806c9f42e8dc1b305c76bc2982", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nでも見守るくらいなら、いいよな？", "zh": "是、是吗……  \n不过，只是在旁边看着的话，应该没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "37b424f2a483903843263b96ea41617511682171b14b5a50dacb0ccf9de1935b", "ja": "仕方ありませんね～。では、おとなしくしているなら、\n隣で見ることくらいは許可してあげましょう～。", "zh": "真拿你没办法呢～那么，只要你乖乖待着，\n我就允许你在旁边看看吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0303_1019_p", "source_sha256": "82ab238aee6c929a58594b597eb131773307d0631f570639d9f6256da45f6dbe", "ja": "（ゲームでも妥協しない姿勢が朋花らしいな。\nよし。最後までクリアできたら、一緒に喜ぼう！）", "zh": "（就算是在游戏里也毫不妥协，这很符合朋花的作风啊。好，等她通关到最后，我们一起庆祝吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
